[Student "S"]
{WEST thinks there might be slam if EAST holds both minor Aces, so he tries Blackwood.

When EAST shows just one Ace WEST is afraid he will have a trump loser as well, so 
he stops at 5\H.

It turns out that WEST might make twelve tricks, depending on the \HK situation.}
[Play "N"]
C2

